---
// Replace the file at this path to update the photograph.
const principalImage = '/images/about/principal.webp';
---

<section class="bg-cream" aria-labelledby="welcome-heading">
  <div data-reveal-stagger class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-center gap-8 px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 md:grid-cols-[14rem_1fr] md:gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[17rem_1fr_20rem] lg:gap-12 lg:py-14">
    <img
      src={principalImage}
      alt="Principal of Vidhya Jyothi School"
      width="250"
      height="300"
      loading="lazy"
      class="aspect-[5/6] w-full max-w-64 rounded-lg object-cover object-top md:max-w-none"
    />

    <div>
      <p class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.15em] text-maroon sm:text-sm">
        WELCOME TO
      </p>
      <h2
        id="welcome-heading"
        class="mt-2 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-navy sm:text-4xl"
      >
        Vidhya Jyothi School
      </h2>
      <div class="mt-3 h-1 w-16 rounded-full bg-gold"></div>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed text-navy/80">
        Since 1982, Vidhya Jyothi School has been committed to providing quality
        education with strong values, helping students grow into responsible,
        confident and compassionate individuals.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-6 text-sm font-bold text-navy">Principal</p>
    </div>

    <figure class="rounded-lg bg-white/70 p-6 md:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1">
      <svg
        class="size-7 text-gold"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        fill="currentColor"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
        <path d="M10 4H4a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v7a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h3.2c-.1 2.1-1.2 3.4-3.2 4l.6 2.2C8.100 18.300 10.500 15.500 10.500 11V5a1 1 0 0 0-.5-1Zm10 0h-6a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v7a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h3.200c-.1 2.100-1.200 3.400-3.200 4l.6 2.200c3.500-.9 5.900-3.700 5.900-8.200V5a1 1 0 0 0-.5-1Z"></path>
      </svg>
      <blockquote class="mt-3 text-lg leading-relaxed text-navy/85">
        At Vidhya Jyothi, we believe in nurturing not just academic excellence,
        but also good values, character and a lifelong love for learning.
      </blockquote>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>
